flowchart LR
    subgraph USER["User controls"]
        U1[Selects tokens & amounts]
        U2[Signs intent:\nroutes, output, recipient,\nminOut, deadline, fee]
        U3[Can reject any prompt\nfree, anytime]
    end

    subgraph CONTRACT["Contract enforces — unconditional"]
        C1[Exact amounts only\nno unlimited approvals exist]
        C2[Approvals reset to 0\nevery leg, success or failure]
        C3[Only allowlisted\ntargets & spenders callable]
        C4[Delta accounting:\nonly this tx's funds touchable]
        C5[Fee hard cap 3%]
        C6[Failed legs skipped\n& refunded same tx]
        C7[Reentrancy guard\n+ self-only execution]
    end

    subgraph OWNER["Owner is trusted for"]
        O1[DEX allowlist contents]
        O2[Fee rate within 3% cap]
        O3[Pause / unpause]
        O4[Rescue of stuck funds only\ncannot enter user txs]
    end

    subgraph BACKEND["Backend is trusted for"]
        B1[Honest route calldata]
        B2[Tight per-leg floors\nfrom fresh quotes]
        B3[Allowlist pre-checks\nconfig + on-chain]
    end

    subgraph EXTERNAL["External dependencies"]
        E1[Permit2 — canonical\nsignature verification]
        E2[Allowlisted DEX routers\nUniswap, Aerodrome, Pancake, ...]
    end

    USER -->|signed intent freezes\nbackend's output| CONTRACT
    BACKEND -->|builds routes,\ncannot alter after signing| CONTRACT
    OWNER -->|config only,\npublic on-chain events| CONTRACT
    CONTRACT --> E1
    CONTRACT --> E2
